{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46895","headline":"送休师归长沙宁觐 · 齐己","name":"送休师归长沙宁觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高堂亲老本师存，多难长悬两处魂。\n已说战尘消汉口，便随征櫂别荆门。\n晴吟野阔无耕地，晚宿湾深有钓村。\n他日更思衰老否，七年相伴琢诗言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}